@startuml 018-results-podium-class
title 018 results-podium：類別圖

class "PodiumPlace" as Place {
  +rank : 1 | 2 | 3
  +score : number
  +teams : string[]
}
class "Podium" as Podium {
  +podiumPlaces(scores) : PodiumPlace[]
  +Podium(scores, scoreLabel, team?)
  -STAND_ORDER = [2, 1, 3]
}
class "TeacherPanel" as Teacher {
  +view : TeacherView
}
class "StudentResults" as Student {
  +team : string
  +scores : Record<string, number>
}
Podium "1" o-- "0..3" Place : 產生
Teacher ..> Podium : ended 時掛載
Student ..> Podium : 掛載並標本組
@enduml
